          %h2#references References
          %h3#generally Generally
          %p Lecture notes:
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Fernando+Ruiz+Ruiz"}> Fernando Ruiz Ruiz
              ,
              = succeed ":" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Peter+van+Nieuwenhuizen"} Peter van Nieuwenhuizen
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  Lectures on Supersymmetry and Supergravity in
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %mn 2
                        %mo +
                        %mn 1
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} 2+1
