              %em 3D Supergravity In the Batalin–Vilkovisky Formalism
              \&amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2412.14300"}> arXiv:2412.14300
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %p See also
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                Gabriele Tartaglino-Mazzucchelli,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    Topics in
