            in 3d supergravity includes
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                Björn Brinne, Svend E. Hjelmeland,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ulf+Lindstr%C3%B6m"} Ulf Lindström
                = succeed "," do
                  %em World-Volume Locally Supersymmetric Born-Infeld Actions
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9904175"} arXiv:hep-th/9904175
            %li
              %p
                Björn Brinne,
                %em 3D supergravity and a spinning D2-brane
          %h3#gauged Gauged
          %p
            Topological
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/gauged+supergravity"} gauged supergravity
            in dimension three was first considered in
          %ul
            %li
              A. Achúcarro and
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Paul+Townsend"} Paul Townsend
              = succeed "," do
                %em A Chern-Simons action for three-dimensional anti-de Sitter supergravity theories
          %p
