            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/KK-compactification"} KK-compactification
            of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/11-dimensional+supergravity"} 11-dimensional supergravity
            on an 8-torus and with global
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/E8"} E8
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/U-duality"} U-duality
            and local
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi SO
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mn 16
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} SO(16)
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/gauge+field"} gauge field
            was discussed in
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bernard+Julia"}> Bernard Julia
                ,
                = succeed "," do
