                %em Unified field theories in more than 4 dimensions
                (V. D. Sabbata and E. Schmutzer, eds.), (Singapore), pp. 215–236, World Scientific, 1983.
            %li
              %p
                N. Marcus,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/John+Schwarz"} John Schwarz
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Three-dimensional supergravity theories
          %p
            The maximally supersymmetric gauged 3d supergravitites (and their
            = succeed ")" do
              %a{:href => "#PossibleGaugings"} exceptional gaugings
          %ul
